        'Art Rare' => 'Art Rare (AR) is the Japanese name for an Illustration Rare: a regular PokÃ©mon in a full-card scene, much scarcer than a holo.',
        'Special Illustration Rare' => 'Special Illustration Rares are each setâ€™s showpiece: unique full artwork for a PokÃ©mon ex or Supporter, marked with two gold stars, and among the hardest cards to pull.',
        'Special Art Rare' => 'Special Art Rare (SAR) is the Japanese name for a Special Illustration Rare, the top art card of a Japanese set and one of its scarcest.',
