<p class="muted">Customer reviews show on the homepage, on a <a href="/reviews" target="_blank">reviews page</a>, and on the product they are about. <?= $rows ? count($rows) . ' review' . (count($rows) === 1 ? '' : 's') . ' Â· average ' . $avg . ' / 5' : '' ?></p>
<p class="note small">Only add real reviews from real customers, in their own words (from email, WhatsApp, eBay, Instagram and so on). Writing reviews yourself or paying for them is illegal in the US under the FTC's rule on fake reviews, and Google removes sites that use them.</p>
